<!--
  ROAD CLOSED glyph: a stop-sign octagon with a bar punched across it — the
  road, barred.

  The octagon is the only rounded-polygon outline in the set and reads as
  "closed/stop" without any text (the word STOP is unreadable at 24dp and is not
  language-neutral, so it is deliberately not drawn). The bar is an evenOdd hole
  so the category colour shows through it.
-->
